[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-classical-bd3 6...Qd8"]
[Name "Classical: 5.Bd3 Qxd4 6.Nf3 Qd8 7.Qe2"]

7. Qe2 e6 { Guards the bishop on f5 and opens the way to castle. }
8. O-O Bxe4 { Swaps off the piece that was tying the pawn down. }
9. Bxe4 Nf6 { Develops with a hit on the bishop. Black has an extra pawn and only has to castle. } *
